comments.body:
Currently @mrpollo is waiting on Linux Foundation to create the new URLs for camera manager and dronecode sdk. He has pinged them several times. 

Originally we were after docs.dronecode.org for combined camera manager and SDK docs. However that won't work because dronecore has versioning, and we can't support different versioning within the one docs package. I can't remember exactly the what the final urls Ramon asked for, but I _think_ it was sdk.dronecode.org and camera-manager.dronecode.org.

@mrpollo Can you go bollock LF again? Can we escalate - this is silly.

